            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "justinmk: done — dropped it to one compact case (no 'statuscolumn' setup, single winbar-row border click), still in mouse_spec since it needs the winbar + border float geometry rather than the minimal floats the focus tests use. note the float is height = 2 on purpose: with height = 1 the winbar is dropped and the same border click becomes a harmless statuscolumn click.",
